Demo CLI.

  php demo.php <command> [options]
  php demo.php help [<command>] [--json]

Read:
  env                    Say which host.
  contracts [--nr=<nr>]  Filter by number.
  events --msa=<msaNr>[,<msaNr>...] [--ids=<id>[,<id>...]]
         [--colours=<red|green|blue>[,...]]
                         Comma-separated values.
  typed --colour=<red|green|blue> [--count=<n>] [--at=<ATOM>] [--on=<Y-m-d>] [--note=<note>]
                         Typed values.
  report [--code=<n>]    Text output, custom exit code.
  nope                   Fail from a helper.
  fault                  Throw something undeclared.

Write:
  save --what=<what>     Write something.
  rename                 Name the running command without a literal.

Options:
  --raw                  Print the raw response.
  --help                 Print this.

Footer prose.
Demo CLI.

  php demo.php env

Say which host.

Options:
  --raw                  Print the raw response.
  --help                 Print this.
Demo CLI.

  php demo.php contracts [--nr=<nr>]

Filter by number.

Options:
  --nr=<nr>              Contract number.
  --raw                  Print the raw response.
  --help                 Print this.
Demo CLI.

  php demo.php events --msa=<msaNr>[,<msaNr>...] [--ids=<id>[,<id>...]]
                      [--colours=<red|green|blue>[,...]]

Comma-separated values.

Options:
  --msa=<msaNr>[,<msaNr>...]
                         MSA numbers. At least 1 value. Required.
  --ids=<id>[,<id>...]   Numeric ids.
  --colours=<red|green|blue>[,...]
                         Colours.
  --raw                  Print the raw response.
  --help                 Print this.
Demo CLI.

  php demo.php typed --colour=<red|green|blue> [--count=<n>] [--at=<ATOM>] [--on=<Y-m-d>]
                     [--note=<note>]

Typed values.

Options:
  --colour=<red|green|blue>
                         A colour. Required.
  --count=<n>            A count. Between 1 and 10. Default: 1.
  --at=<ATOM>            A moment.
  --on=<Y-m-d>           A date.
  --note=<note>          Free text. Default: empty.
  --raw                  Print the raw response.
  --help                 Print this.
Demo CLI.

  php demo.php report [--code=<n>]

Text output, custom exit code.

Options:
  --code=<n>             Exit with this instead of 0. Default: 0.
  --raw                  Print the raw response.
  --help                 Print this.
Demo CLI.

  php demo.php save --what=<what>

Write something.

Options:
  --what=<what>          What to save. Required.
  --raw                  Print the raw response.
  --confirm              Actually write.
  --help                 Print this.
